<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks fall to 59,925.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks fall to 59,925.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Sept 19 totaled 59,925 bales, down slightly from 59,991 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were four bales issued, 3,480 decertification orders, 70 cancellations, and no bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
